{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The alchemist &quot;Ruby&quot; comes to you, a floater, to ask for a favor. As you adventure with her, you will deepen your relationship, become lovers, and have sex. The destiny of both her and you will begin to change in the pursuit of the &quot;Great Philosopher's Stone.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis game is only available in Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774720/extras/e17f8e8cc849a6e80eccc1d83f7617e8.poster.avif?t=1753916485\" width=616 height=471 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774720/extras/e17f8e8cc849a6e80eccc1d83f7617e8.webm?t=1753916485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Game specifications, etc.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Loop voices/climax voices/battle voices are all recorded in Japanese specifically for this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Event H: 24 scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy H: 40 scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000*This function allows you to instantly play ejaculation scenes with one touch during your adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605All H scenes in Event H and Easy H are exclusive CG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Estimated play time: Approximately 8 to 12 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0System functions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use alchemy to synthesize materials and create items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create various golems from monster cores using alchemy and fight together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy easy gameplay with different difficulty settings, or enjoy hard boss battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- For those who find it even more tedious, there is a full recollection unlock function! (You can also undo full unlocks)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There are no annoying elements such as scenario branching, END branching, or time-limited events!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774720?t=1753916485","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3774720?t=1753916485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774720/c5eb3ace1dafc921456bc5f4771a99ab19e3c189/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753916485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774720/c5eb3ace1dafc921456bc5f4771a99ab19e3c189/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753916485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"There are some conversations about killing.\r\nThere are depictions of trespassing and stealing to achieve a goal.\r\nThere are depictions of fertilization resulting in physical strengthening instead of pregnancy.\r\nThis game contains sexual content such as sexual acts and sexual acts with tentacles. The heroine's sexual partner is only the protagonist, the player, and is conducted by mutual consent. Sexual acts with tentacles are the result of the protagonist's transformation through an alchemy potion. There are no NTR elements. Please use your own judgment as to whether or not to play.\r\nAll of the heroine's sexual act voices were recorded in Japanese specifically for this game."},"demos":[{"appid":3776200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The alchemist &quot;Ruby&quot; comes to you, a floater, to ask for a favor. As you adventure with 